{"id":"andauernd","lemma":"andauernd","pos":"adj","rank":3247,"glosses":["constant, incessant (occuring very often, not necessarily a strictly ongoing activity)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/07/De-andauernd.ogg/De-andauernd.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Warum kämpft ihr zwei andauernd?","en":"Why are you two always fighting?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to fight, to struggle","l":"kämpfen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"},null]},{"text":"Er lacht andauernd.","en":"He is always laughing.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to laugh","l":"lachen"},null]},{"text":"Ich esse andauernd hier.","en":"I eat here all the time.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"essen"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Er will uns andauernd irgendwas sagen.","en":"He's always trying to say something to us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Die Leute fragen mich das andauernd.","en":"People keep asking me that.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to ask"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},null]}]}